---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 text-sm font-bold text-white">
            $
          </span>
          <span class="font-sans text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
            Bani<span class="text-brand-600">Online</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          Curs practic de bani online pentru începători. Metode simple, verificate și oneste — fără scheme, fără promisiuni false.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">Stripe securizat</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">PayPal</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">Payoneer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Curs</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="/curs" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Toate modulele</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Ghid gratuit</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Preț</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Suport</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="/contact" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Contact</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:suport@banionline.ro" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">suport@banionline.ro</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Legal</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="/termeni" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Termeni și condiții</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Confidențialitate</a></li>
          <li><a href="/afiliati" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">Declarație de afiliere</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6 sm:flex-row">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">© {year} BaniOnline. Toate drepturile rezervate.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Suport: <a href="mailto:suport@banionline.ro" class="text-slate-500 transition-colors hover:text-brand-600">suport@banionline.ro</a> · Veniturile variază. Nimeni nu poate garanta câștiguri.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
